BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//WorkBuddy//Game Version Calendar//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Genshin - Version Calendar
X-WR-CALDESC:Only Genshin Impact previews and version updates. Leaving a ga
 me? On iPhone just delete that calendar. On Android\, switch OFF "show" in
  Calendar account settings instead of tapping Delete - deleting one URL su
 bscription removes all of them.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:genshin-72-release@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261104T030000Z
DTEND:20261104T033000Z
SUMMARY:Genshin Impact 7.2 Version Update
DESCRIPTION:Servers go down for maintenance at 06:00 and should be back aro
 und 11:00 (UTC+8). Adds a new 5-star Electro character\, a Furina rerun\, 
 and a new Snezhnaya story chapter with a new map area.\n\nAll times are Be
 ijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated or TBC are projected from ve
 rsion cycles and may shift once officially announced.
LOCATION:Genshin Impact
CATEGORIES:Genshin Impact
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P1D
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Version update tomorrow
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT2H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Version update - servers opening soon
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
