DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261207T040000Z
DTEND:20261207T041500Z
SUMMARY:Genshin 7.3 - Redemption codes expire (Computed)
DESCRIPTION:Valid 64 hours: stream starts Dec 04\, 20:00\, codes die Dec 07
 \, 12:00 (UTC+8).\n\nThree codes worth 300 Primogems total\, plus Mystic E
 nhancement Ore\, Hero's Wit and Mora.\nOnce they expire they are gone - no
  reissues\, no appeals.\n\nRedeem in game under Settings > Account > Redem
 ption Code\, or on the official redemption website.\nMissed the stream? Th
 e VOD description and the official preview page usually list all three cod
 es.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated or TB
 C are projected from version cycles and may shift once officially announce
 d.
LOCATION:Genshin Impact - Redemption page
CATEGORIES:Genshin Impact
STATUS:CONFIRMED
